# gateway-web

- App Router under `apps/gateway-web/app/`.
- No database clients here. Call backend HTTP APIs (via Caddy in local stack).
- Prefer server components for public pages; client components only for interactive editor UI.
- Match existing TypeScript style: explicit props types, no extra UI libraries unless asked.
